  "articleBody": "Build a renovation budget by defining the work, inspecting the existing home, separating fixed costs from selections and allowances, confirming design and permit responsibilities, and reserving funds for approved changes or concealed conditions. A useful budget is specific enough to compare proposals and flexible enough to accommodate decisions made during design and construction.",
